            {
              "dsDescriptionValue": {
                "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                "typeClass": "primitive",
                "multiple": false,
                "value": "<p>Records of small-scale fishing trips landed around Timor-Leste, collected for <a href=\"https://timor.peskas.org\">Peskas Timor-Leste</a>, the country's official national fisheries monitoring system. Enumerators working with the Ministry of Agriculture and Fisheries record landings at landing sites with KoboToolbox: date, place, crew size, trip duration, gear, boat, habitat, and for each catch the species, length, estimated weight and value.</p><p>One row is one catch from one fishing trip. The table has passed automated checks and is the one the <a href=\"https://api.peskas.org/docs\">Peskas Fishery Data API</a> serves for Timor-Leste as validated landings. A new version is published every month under the same DOI, each holding the whole table from 2017 onwards.</p><p>README.md describes every column, how the data is produced and its limits. Releases from March 2022 to June 2025 are separate datasets in the <a href=\"https://dataverse.harvard.edu/dataverse/peskas\">Peskas collection</a>, with different files.</p>"
              }
            }
          ]
